sell_v1_thesis_drift.user_template:
This {sector} company was purchased {time_since_entry} ago. Compare the risk factors at ENTRY vs NOW:

RISK FACTORS AT ENTRY (filed {entry_filed}):
{entry_risk_factors}

CURRENT RISK FACTORS (filed {current_filed}):
{current_risk_factors}

Have NEW material risks appeared that were NOT part of the original investment thesis? The original risks are "known" — they were accepted when the position was entered. We only care about SURPRISES.

If the original risks are the same (even if still present), the thesis is intact.
If fundamentally new problems have emerged, the thesis may be broken.

Respond with JSON only:
{"thesis_intact": true or false, "action": "hold" or "sell", "confidence": "high" or "medium" or "low", "new_risks": ["list of genuinely new risks not present at entry"], "resolved_risks": ["list of entry risks that have been resolved"]}

